5","order":5,"excerpt":"阜，肥大。骐骝，红黑色马；中，指两服马。騧骊，黑嘴黄马与黑马；骖，旁马。龙盾之合，谓两盾合载于车。觼軜，以白铜装饰骖马内辔之环。邑，西戎县邑。方，将。胡然，为什么。","anchors":[{"key":"5-1","segmentId":"seg-011","surfaceText":"阜","charStart":4,"charEnd":4},{"key":"5-2","segmentId":"seg-013","surfaceText":"骐骝","charStart":1,"charEnd":2},{"key":"5-3","segmentId":"seg-013","surfaceText":"中","charStart":4,"charEnd":4},{"key":"5-4","segmentId":"seg-014","surfaceText":"騧骊","charStart":1,"charEnd":2},{"key":"5-5","segmentId":"seg-014","surfaceText":"骖","charStart":4,"charEnd":4},{"key":"5-6","segmentId":"seg-015","surfaceText":"龙盾之合","charStart":1,"charEnd":4},{"key":"5-7","segmentId":"seg-016","surfaceText":"觼軜","charStart":3,"charEnd":4},{"key":"5-8","segmentId":"seg-018","surfaceText":"邑","charStart":4,"charEnd":4},{"key":"5-9","segmentId":"seg-019","surfaceText":"方","charStart":1,"charEnd":1},{"key":"5-10","segmentId":"seg-020","surfaceText":"胡然","charStart":1,"charEnd":2}]},{"id":"part-6","order":6,"excerpt":"俴驷孔群，厹矛鋈錞。蒙伐有苑，虎韔镂膺。交韔二弓，竹闭绲縢。言念君子，载寝载兴。厌厌良人，秩秩德音。","anchors":[{"key":"6-1","segmentId":"seg-021","surfaceText":"俴驷孔群","charStart":1,"charEnd":4},{"key":"6-2","segmentId":"seg-022","surfaceText":"厹矛鋈錞","charStart":1,"charEnd":4},{"key":"6-3","segmentId":"seg-023","surfaceText":"蒙伐有苑","charStart":1,"charEnd":4},{"key":"6-4","segmentId":"seg-024","surfaceText":"虎韔镂膺","charStart":1,"charEnd":4},{"key":"6-5","segmentId":"seg-025","surfaceText":"交韔二弓","charStart":1,"charEnd":4},{"key":"6-6","segmentId":"seg-026","surfaceText":"竹闭绲縢","charStart":1,"charEnd":4},{"key":"6-7","segmentId":"seg-027","surfaceText":"言念君子","charStart":1,"charEnd":4},{"key":"6-8","segmentId":"seg-028","surfaceText":"载寝载兴","charStart":1,"charEnd":4},{"key":"6-9","segmentId":"seg-029","surfaceText":"厌厌良人","charStart":1,"charEnd":4},{"key":"6-10","segmentId":"seg-030","surfaceText":"秩秩德音","charStart":1,"charEnd":4}]},{"id":"part-7","order":7,"excerpt":"俴驷，不披甲的四马。厹矛，三棱长矛。鋈錞，以白铜装饰矛柄末端。蒙伐有苑，谓中盾刻有美丽杂羽纹。虎韔，虎皮弓袋。镂膺，弓袋前部有雕饰。竹闭绲縢，以竹制校弓器用绳缠束。载寝载兴，睡卧起身都不安。厌厌，安静娴雅。良人，女子称丈夫。秩秩德音，言其举止有序、声誉美好。","anchors":[{"key":"7-1","segmentId":"seg-021","surfaceText":"俴驷","charStart":1,"charEnd":2},{"key":"7-2","segmentId":"seg-022","surfaceText":"厹矛","charStart":1,"charEnd":2},{"key":"7-3","segmentId":"seg-022","surfaceText":"鋈錞","charStart":3,"charEnd":4},{"key":"7-4","segmentId":"seg-023","surfaceText":"蒙伐有苑","charStart":1,"charEnd":4},{"key":"7-5","segmentId":"seg-024","surfaceText":"虎韔","charStart":1,"charEnd":2},{"key":"7-6","segmentId":"seg-024","surfaceText":"镂膺","charStart":3,"charEnd":4},{"key":"7-7","segmentId":"seg-026","surfaceText":"竹闭绲縢","charStart":1,"charEnd":4},{"key":"7-8","segmentId":"seg-028","surfaceText":"载寝载兴","charStart":1,"charEnd":4},{"key":"7-9","segmentId":"seg-029","surfaceText":"厌厌","charStart":1,"charEnd":2},{"key":"7-10","segmentId":"seg-029","surfaceText":"良人","charStart":3,"charEnd":4},{"key":"7-11","segmentId":"seg-030","surfaceText":"秩秩德音","charStart":1,"charEnd":4}]},{"id":"part-8","order":8,"excerpt":"韵读：幽部收、辀；侯部驱、续、毂、馵、玉、屋、曲；幽部阜、手；东侵合韵中、骖；缉部合、軜、邑；之部期、之；文部群、錞；蒸侵通韵膺、弓、縢、兴、音。","anchors":[{"key":"8-1","segmentId":"seg-001","surfaceText":"收","charStart":4,"charEnd":4},{"key":"8-2","segmentId":"seg-002","surfaceText":"辀","charStart":4,"charEnd":4},{"key":"8-3","segmentId":"seg-003","surfaceText":"驱","charStart":4,"charEnd":4},{"key":"8-4","segmentId":"seg-004","surfaceText":"续","charStart":4,"charEnd":4},{"key":"8-5","segmentId":"seg-005","surfaceText":"毂","charStart":4,"charEnd":4},{"key":"8-6","segmentId":"seg-006","surfaceText":"馵","charStart":4,"charEnd":4},{"key":"8-7","segmentId":"seg-008","surfaceText":"玉","charStart":4,"charEnd":4},{"key":"8-8","segmentId":"seg-009","surfaceText":"屋","charStart":4,"charEnd":4},{"key":"8-9","segmentId":"seg-010","surfaceText":"曲","charStart":4,"charEnd":4},{"key":"8-10","segmentId":"seg-011","surfaceText":"阜","charStart":4,"charEnd":4},{"key":"8-11","segmentId":"seg-012","surfaceText":"手","charStart":4,"charEnd":4},{"key":"8-12","segmentId":"seg-013","surfaceText":"中",